{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "e7afed58d0c3c6f680aa29930c64d4e4a2c7c87bdd864b5155ea2ab52dfafdca", "ja": "開花前線、到来中♪", "zh": "开花前线，到来中♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "602ef7ae845e4fade25f9204208efb10b1b8e6c285c7796781de5b70a9becef4", "ja": "公演とCM撮影が一段落し、花壇の様子を見\nに行く一同。件の女の子の花も無事に咲き、\n喜ぶアイドル達。花のように綻ぶたくさんの\n笑顔を見ながら、これからも頑張ろうと決意\nを新たにするプロデューサー。", "zh": "公演和广告拍摄暂告一段落，大家一起去看看花坛的情况。那位女孩子的花也顺利绽放了，偶像们都很开心。看着那一张张如花朵般绽放的笑脸，制作人也重新下定决心，今后要继续努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "77bcaa566b04a0ed6f8ba55da77c6a08749ec28bb1279572f08783b68df56c83", "ja": "（天体公演は無事終了！　CMの撮影も一段落\nした頃、ガーデニング教室から連絡があった）", "zh": "（天体公演顺利结束！CM的拍摄也告一段落，正当这时，园艺教室那边传来了消息）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "89dad51a0137f7d5bd2765a42c0ff189c520ab00f5ac00c114fe90c036d5cf4f", "ja": "（育てた花壇が見頃になったというので、\n早速みんなで見に来た……）", "zh": "（听说我们种的花坛到了最佳观赏期，\n于是大家马上过来看看……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "7c5c45f7e96b2167e6c04a3b27856a01273160251c6fcee008624ee5a66ca70e", "ja": "わあ～、すごい……。\nどこを見ても、きれいなお花でいっぱいだね！", "zh": "哇～好厉害……  \n不管看哪里，都满是漂亮的花呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "23d6a5036782026a8fd90c9e50b406a26f0e57c63bcfafd5a06dc1e17973f698", "ja": "はい。それにお花のいい香りも……ふふっ♪\nとっても素敵です！", "zh": "是的，而且还有花朵的香气……呵呵♪  \n真是太美好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "e1c1e3cb2b12dc5916e247301a7b656258d3d0917d23bd81c4ce633a00aec908", "ja": "最近は、ポカポカ陽気でしたから。お花さんにも、\n春が来たって、わかったのかもしれないですね～。", "zh": "最近天气暖洋洋的嘛。花儿们也感觉到春天来了，说不定呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "24e59d798b63dd9561a7bde932eb013c9113a499c1ef116ad8987f6540453b87", "ja": "そうだな。陽気がよくて一気に成長したって、\nさっき先生も言ってたよ。", "zh": "是啊，天气暖和，长得也快，刚才老师也是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a26ab6d3015aa776f50d9b408ebb276321c82e3f7cd55ff92fbbc80a1d6a6df2", "ja": "も、桃子ちゃん桃子ちゃん！\nこっちに来て！", "zh": "桃、桃子！快过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "63b61403b89ac48b46a93bf454acd716e7a6fdf0e589a99e9a2faa6859e58b37", "ja": "風花さん？\nそんなに慌ててどうしたの！", "zh": "风花姐？\n你这么慌慌张张的，是怎么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "d02458ccbf89315854489e5df2e3aabb333d00fb3c3f06b47179b73b8d10999d", "ja": "あれ？　この花壇って、桃子たちの……。", "zh": "咦？这个花坛，不是桃子她们的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d1130d15d9bec106d742d23100085b2e694a7967ec79668a43f0d88b0f4fc259", "ja": "そうだよ。ほら、ここ……\nあの子が育てた花なんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊。你看，这里……\n是那孩子培育的花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "ee9de8ced65c38f256f75d09292a07ecf9238116d49b2cd9304bf7f84840076a", "ja": "あっ。咲いてる……。\nちっちゃいお花だね。ふふっ、かわいい♪", "zh": "啊。开花了……\n是朵小小的花呢。呵呵，好可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "ecc839444086af5c3ed56c720713f0ebcaa52111f7a1f849bc201822025ef137", "ja": "ええ。小さくても、堂々と咲いてるわね！\nとっても素敵だわ。", "zh": "嗯。虽然很小，却开得很大方呢！\n真是漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e65f6ccf0b22f2b21c652c3978c6a24235f77e2b3e39b8a954587d10efe34179", "ja": "よかったな、桃子。\nきっとあの女の子も喜んでるはずだ。", "zh": "太好了，桃子。那个女孩肯定也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "8248338c0293fdc16291d4b2ccdf389e76a0aefd4507b2494d90fae6309fddaf", "ja": "うん！　……で、でも、桃子は何もしてないよ。\n桃子たちのお世話の、ついでだっただけだし。", "zh": "嗯！……可、可是，桃子什么都没做呀。\n只是顺便照顾了一下桃子她们而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "174265fb7f5790a0089f70ba00bd1e0d446c65d27f6c81db519b9ad04abbfa54", "ja": "ええ、そうね。美也ちゃんとエミリーちゃんも、\nお世話してくれてありがとう！", "zh": "嗯，是啊。也谢谢美也和艾米莉照顾我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "501eae6b8734cc267a91f1a0c64a8afd83358d4bc5c1256b341e54c7dbd2d674", "ja": "私たちがCM撮影や公演の準備で来られない時、\n代わりに来てくれてたんだものね。", "zh": "我们因为拍广告或准备演出没办法过来的时候，你们代替我们来照顾了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "666c31911cb3a3f82acb72d27e027264bc5121578c55d4a44c1d08136c860f56", "ja": "いえいえ～。お世話で得た経験が、私達の収録でも\n役に立ちましたから。ね、エミリーちゃん♪", "zh": "哪里哪里～。照料花草积累的经验，在我们录制的时候\n也帮了大忙呢。对吧，艾米莉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "4fdacb6f59d8ebd30cbc80324ddf9207f159c1553944b5e5f33b02bf0a992847", "ja": "そうなんです。「花のことをよく勉強している」と、\n花束職人の先生にほめていただきました♪", "zh": "就是这样。花束师傅还夸奖我说：“你对花很有研究。”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cd12d0f0034d03dccce2cd02d139a1b5b5eb109ec7599390cc39c8a424639984", "ja": "それはよかった。おかげで、こっちの\nCM撮影も上手くいったよ。ありがとう！", "zh": "那太好了。多亏了你，这边的CM拍摄也顺利完成了。谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "b701d339622d25af13187cb752bbfcd8ec61843a2ef5e247a9a499934dbaf6db", "ja": "今日もここに来る前に、みんなのCMを見ましたよ～。\n桃子ちゃんが大人っぽくて、ビックリしました～。", "zh": "今天来这里之前，我也看了大家的广告哦～  \n桃子看起来好成熟，让我吓了一跳～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "d03c1ddc4d868d8655f5fa470d91cb00c8ff538fb081cd11ff34b411606f8f07", "ja": "えっ、本当に！？　……ま、まあ、当然だけどね。\n桃子は演技なんてしなくても、大人っぽいし。", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？……嘛、不过这也是当然的吧。\n桃子就算不演戏，也很有大人的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "dfcc232999a75237ce5b3f735afdf6349dbf62435906ff54f417b865f11d5683", "ja": "……でも、このユニットで一番大人だったのは、\nやっぱりこのみさんだったかも。", "zh": "……不过，在这个组合里最成熟的，\n说不定果然还是木实小姐呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d9347daa4ab87a85d32df66e67cdc47758b8fe31c1e9ae8c6ef9aceb2a355e60", "ja": "私もそう思うな。話を聞いてくれたり、見守って\nくれたり。いろいろ助けてもらっちゃったね……。", "zh": "我也这么觉得。你会听我们倾诉，也一直守护着我们，真的受你照顾了很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4de19857f9def9624762877b35cb651fdce31017c7c048a659b4160dfa95de01", "ja": "そうだな。本当に助かりました。", "zh": "是啊。真的帮了大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "a27888accab3e032fadc1bce6c1ea7b715e312bdd155065afb3263fa660c5666", "ja": "ふふっ。ふたりとも、手のかかる妹みたいなものね。\nだからつい、お節介を焼いちゃっただけよ。", "zh": "呵呵。你们两个，就像是让人操心的妹妹一样呢。\n所以一不小心就多管了些闲事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "2f4974b6e877f6a55ca94d7e6ac4a85ecba4c692a459bbc526d57adbcb4671e2", "ja": "ふ、ふーん……妹かぁ。", "zh": "唔、嗯……妹妹啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5646756eb8191b32265e47b322c7de3ad063e2f5d5f915b33d4160a3b9c1c9d8", "ja": "私は、姉がいるんですけど。このみさんが\nお姉ちゃんだったら、なんだか甘えちゃいそう♪", "zh": "我有一个姐姐。不过，如果风花小姐是我的姐姐，总觉得我会忍不住向您撒娇呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d85e00de1e5f5c774d86b5b42c0d2776675a94a2a3531546b152d63183972b82", "ja": "ありがとう、このみお姉ちゃん……なんて。", "zh": "谢谢你，小此木姐姐……开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "46d3efe847f18278d605698d52ee6e054e34a3424222c630e7a9b4460465b471", "ja": "私も妹がいるから、『お姉ちゃん』は\n呼ばれ慣れてるんだけど……悪くないわね！", "zh": "我也有妹妹，所以『姐姐』这个称呼我已经听惯了……不过，感觉也不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "093ef16b5b8b0b16dd1ef39b46a495e1d4449d83f5d9a7e6979b3acc7b2867bd", "ja": "ねえ、みんなもちょっと、私のこと\n『お姉ちゃん』って呼んでみない？", "zh": "呐，大家也试着叫我一声“姐姐”看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "3485d7063aa96f09c10f50300f0ed20b6cd43ebc48b92ec68b6f0672c6dc2ee7", "ja": "まあ、私もいいのですか？　では……。\nこのみお姉さま！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "哎呀，我也能这样称呼吗？那么……\n木实姐姐大人！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "edb3249a00084d2eaead4f1e06c4ffb4a5056edbfc2c32403ce9b07ffaef7fa0", "ja": "このみお姉ちゃん～♪\nほら、桃子ちゃんも、呼んでみてください～。", "zh": "木实姐姐～♪\n来，桃子也试着叫叫看吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "9af068b9d40c0e98ab175e1f621aad53a712deda4a2e975f7cc91dcc822d552c", "ja": "えっ！？　も、桃子は……。", "zh": "诶！？桃、桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "ce3e766e64d6affc8139124a658a7f9e3662d1750345c4e4761420d574af9d30", "ja": "あら、桃子ちゃん。\n遠慮しなくてもいいのよ？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "哎呀，小桃子。\n不用这么见外的哦？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "b6c73d0414f00b75c0c8b0a56067f8f8b4bd4e82d2790219744ade007c8df411", "ja": "遠慮とかじゃないから！\nお、お兄ちゃん、この流れどうにかして！", "zh": "才不是因为客气呢！\n哥、哥哥，快想办法改变一下这个状况！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "f97705016a63f865d07f52daf70ca846a85566c3e5a353c56609ccfe074f193c", "ja": "別に恥ずかしがる事ないと思うぞ？\nほら、こうやって……。", "zh": "我觉得没什么好害羞的吧？\n你看，就像这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_1036", "source_sha256": "bb04c8796b5b37aaf7987d1d785bd38b9a34aefe0a488c0c509dc170f9878a98", "ja": "このみお姉ちゃん！", "zh": "木实姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b22075a0104525aec76e13f10546e2d2c8c3b5e161791beb0587b2e8db54e273", "ja": "ほら、簡単だろ？", "zh": "看，很简单吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_2001_049mom", "source_sha256": "3112ac376528185462a78f681386413a6501cbbf5d8b73cc5f36f883559ac1c8", "ja": "お兄ちゃんまで……！\n風花さん！　笑ってないで、助けて！", "zh": "连哥哥也……！\n风花姐！别光笑，帮帮我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0224_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_07_2002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "09b7e971ffcdedfc68a32aba9a709a77307c8ba05a29c04b18e1e2cc139193f7", "ja": "ふふっ、どうしようかな？　でも、せっかくだから……\n私も『お姉ちゃん』って呼んでほしいな～、なんて♪", "zh": "呵呵，我该怎么办呢？不过，难得有这个机会……我也想让你叫我一声“姐姐”呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
